            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Surbrillance"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold a modifier and drag anywhere in a window — no aiming at the titlebar or a 4px edge. A resize takes the corner of the quarter you press in; the opposite corner stays put. Drag to a screen edge or corner and the snap zone lights up: let go there and the window tiles to it, gaps included.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold a modifier and drag anywhere in a window — no aiming at the titlebar or a 4px edge. A resize takes the corner of the quarter you press in; the opposite corner stays put. Drag to a screen edge or corner and the snap zone lights up: let go there and the window tiles to it, gaps included."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez un modificateur et faites glisser n'importe où dans une fenêtre — sans viser la barre de titre ni un bord de 4 px. Un redimensionnement prend le coin du quart où vous appuyez ; le coin opposé reste en place. Amenez le pointeur vers un bord ou un coin de l'écran et la zone d'aimantation s'allume : relâchez là et la fenêtre s'y pave, écarts compris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold to open the switcher; release to switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold to open the switcher; release to switch."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenez pour ouvrir le sélecteur, relâchez pour basculer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Cmd-Tab itself starts and presents itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How Cmd-Tab itself starts and presents itself."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La façon dont Cmd-Tab démarre et se présente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the pointer has to be still first. This is what separates stopping at a window from crossing it on the way somewhere else — shorter is more eager, and too short retargets your typing mid-sentence.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long the pointer has to be still first. This is what separates stopping at a window from crossing it on the way somewhere else — shorter is more eager, and too short retargets your typing mid-sentence."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le temps pendant lequel le pointeur doit rester immobile. C'est ce qui distingue s'arrêter sur une fenêtre de la traverser en allant ailleurs — plus court est plus empressé, et trop court redirige votre frappe en pleine phrase."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How the switcher opens, what it lists, and where it appears.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How the switcher opens, what it lists, and where it appears."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La façon dont le sélecteur s'ouvre, ce qu'il liste et où il apparaît."
          }
        }
      }
    },
