    "Keep the per-key tracing in the system log, so a problem can be read back afterwards instead of having to happen again while you watch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep the per-key tracing in the system log, so a problem can be read back afterwards instead of having to happen again while you watch."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserve le suivi touche par touche dans le journal du système, pour qu'un problème puisse être relu après coup au lieu de devoir se reproduire sous vos yeux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the window's size and its relative position on the new display. Live whether or not tiling is on: a move changes no layout, so the switch above does not govern it, and a bound chord is claimed system-wide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the window's size and its relative position on the new display. Live whether or not tiling is on: a move changes no layout, so the switch above does not govern it, and a bound chord is claimed system-wide."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conserve la taille de la fenêtre et sa position relative sur le nouvel écran. Actif que le pavage soit activé ou non : un déplacement ne change aucune disposition, donc l'interrupteur ci-dessus ne le régit pas, et un raccourci associé est revendiqué pour tout le système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
