            "value": "Pastilles numérotées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default — unlike the display moves, this one drives the mouse and flashes Mission Control, so it is not claimed until you ask.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default — unlike the display moves, this one drives the mouse and flashes Mission Control, so it is not claimed until you ask."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé par défaut — contrairement aux déplacements d'écran, celui-ci pilote la souris et fait apparaître Mission Control, il n'est donc pas revendiqué tant que vous ne le demandez pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Each binding is a real global hotkey — while tiling is on, Cmd-Tab takes those combinations from whatever app is in front, so nothing is claimed until you ask for it. Displays and Focus are the exceptions: moving a window is not resizing it and moving the keyboard is not either, so both stay live whatever this switch says.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Each binding is a real global hotkey — while tiling is on, Cmd-Tab takes those combinations from whatever app is in front, so nothing is claimed until you ask for it. Displays and Focus are the exceptions: moving a window is not resizing it and moving the keyboard is not either, so both stay live whatever this switch says."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé par défaut. Chaque association est un véritable raccourci global — tant que le pavage est actif, Cmd-Tab prend ces combinaisons à l'application au premier plan, donc rien n'est revendiqué avant que vous ne le demandiez. Écrans et Focus font exception : déplacer une fenêtre n'est pas la redimensionner, et déplacer le clavier non plus, donc les deux restent actifs quel que soit cet interrupteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off leaves every ⌥-key to the filter. Off by default: quitting an app is not something to discover by mistyping a search.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off leaves every ⌥-key to the filter. Off by default: quitting an app is not something to discover by mistyping a search."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé, toutes les touches ⌥ restent au filtre. Désactivé par défaut : quitter une application ne doit pas se découvrir en tapant une recherche de travers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off leaves no menu-bar item. Reopen Cmd-Tab from Finder to get Settings back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off leaves no menu-bar item. Reopen Cmd-Tab from Finder to get Settings back."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé, aucun élément n'apparaît dans la barre des menus. Rouvrez Cmd-Tab depuis le Finder pour retrouver les réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, the switcher records what it did — sessions opening, picks, tiling, anything that failed. On, it also records every key it saw getting there. Leave it off unless you are chasing something; it is a line per keystroke.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off, the switcher records what it did — sessions opening, picks, tiling, anything that failed. On, it also records every key it saw getting there. Leave it off unless you are chasing something; it is a line per keystroke."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivée, le sélecteur consigne ce qu'il a fait — ouvertures de session, choix, pavage, tout ce qui a échoué. Activée, il consigne aussi chaque touche vue en chemin. Laissez-la désactivée sauf si vous cherchez quelque chose : cela fait une ligne par frappe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On keeps each app's windows in a run. Off ranks every window against every other by when you last used it, so one tap of the trigger goes to the window you were in before this one whichever app it belongs to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On keeps each app's windows in a run. Off ranks every window against every other by when you last used it, so one tap of the trigger goes to the window you were in before this one whichever app it belongs to."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé, les fenêtres de chaque application restent groupées. Désactivé, chaque fenêtre est classée par rapport à toutes les autres selon sa dernière utilisation : une seule pression du déclencheur mène à la fenêtre précédant celle-ci, quelle que soit son application."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only apps with an override are listed. Everything else follows the global settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only apps with an override are listed. Everything else follows the global settings."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seules les applications ayant un réglage particulier sont listées. Toutes les autres suivent les réglages globaux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only for window previews on hover. Everything else works without it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only for window previews on hover. Everything else works without it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uniquement pour les aperçus de fenêtres au survol. Tout le reste fonctionne sans."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only windows on the Desktop (Space) in front. With more than one display, each has its own front Desktop and both count as here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only windows on the Desktop (Space) in front. With more than one display, each has its own front Desktop and both count as here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uniquement les fenêtres du bureau (Space) au premier plan. Avec plusieurs écrans, chacun a son propre bureau au premier plan et les deux comptent comme « ici »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the repository in your browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
