    "Press the same half twice to step the window through ½ → ⅔ → ⅓ of the screen on that side.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the same half twice to step the window through ½ → ⅔ → ⅓ of the screen on that side."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appuyez deux fois sur la même moitié pour faire passer la fenêtre par ½ → ⅔ → ⅓ de l'écran de ce côté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressed while the panel is up — on top of the held trigger, or on their own once it is released in Stay open. Scrolling or hovering over a tile moves the selection too, and a click switches straight to it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pressed while the panel is up — on top of the held trigger, or on their own once it is released in Stay open. Scrolling or hovering over a tile moves the selection too, and a click switches straight to it."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À presser pendant que le panneau est ouvert — en plus du déclencheur maintenu, ou seules une fois celui-ci relâché en mode Rester ouvert. Faire défiler ou survoler une vignette déplace aussi la sélection, et un clic y bascule directement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
