    "Releasing the trigger leaves the switcher up instead of switching. Tab, Return, a click or 1–9/0 then picks; Escape backs out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Releasing the trigger leaves the switcher up instead of switching. Tab, Return, a click or 1–9/0 then picks; Escape backs out."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relâcher le déclencheur laisse le sélecteur ouvert au lieu de basculer. Tab, Retour, un clic ou 1–9/0 choisissent alors ; Échap referme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remembers where every window sat under each set of monitors and puts them back when that set returns — the undo macOS has never had for undocking. It has to have seen a desk before it can restore it, so the first plug or unplug after switching this on only learns; the one after that restores. Kept in memory for the session, never written to disk.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remembers where every window sat under each set of monitors and puts them back when that set returns — the undo macOS has never had for undocking. It has to have seen a desk before it can restore it, so the first plug or unplug after switching this on only learns; the one after that restores. Kept in memory for the session, never written to disk."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retient la place de chaque fenêtre sous chaque ensemble d'écrans et les y remet lorsque cet ensemble revient — l'annulation que macOS n'a jamais eue pour le débranchement. Il faut avoir vu une configuration avant de pouvoir la rétablir : le premier branchement ou débranchement après activation ne fait qu'apprendre, le suivant rétablit. Conservé en mémoire pour la session, jamais écrit sur le disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Required. Without it the event tap cannot see ⌘-Tab, and windows cannot be raised.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Required. Without it the event tap cannot see ⌘-Tab, and windows cannot be raised."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obligatoire. Sans elle, la capture d'événements ne peut pas voir ⌘-Tab et les fenêtres ne peuvent pas être mises au premier plan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
