    "Rest the cursor over a window and the keyboard goes to it, with no click. Off by default: it changes where every keystroke on the machine lands, which is not a thing to switch on for someone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rest the cursor over a window and the keyboard goes to it, with no click. Off by default: it changes where every keystroke on the machine lands, which is not a thing to switch on for someone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laissez le curseur au repos sur une fenêtre et le clavier lui revient, sans clic. Désactivé par défaut : cela change la destination de chaque frappe de la machine, ce qui ne s'active pas à la place de quelqu'un."
          }
        }
      }
    },
