    "Sizes and positions only — the Displays moves and the Focus chords do not wait on this. Defaults sit on ⌃⌘, which macOS leaves almost entirely free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sizes and positions only — the Displays moves and the Focus chords do not wait on this. Defaults sit on ⌃⌘, which macOS leaves almost entirely free."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailles et positions uniquement — les déplacements d'écran et les raccourcis de focus n'en dépendent pas. Les valeurs par défaut sont sur ⌃⌘, que macOS laisse presque entièrement libre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slack around each icon, inside its highlight.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slack around each icon, inside its highlight."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marge autour de chaque icône, à l'intérieur de sa surbrillance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snap by dragging": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Snap by dragging"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aimanter par glissement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snap the focused window without reaching for its edges. These work system-wide, whether or not the switcher is open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Snap the focused window without reaching for its edges. These work system-wide, whether or not the switcher is open."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aimantez la fenêtre active sans attraper ses bords. Ces raccourcis fonctionnent pour tout le système, que le sélecteur soit ouvert ou non."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snaps the highlighted window to that half of its display — the same tile the global ⌃⌘-arrow chord makes, gap and width cycle included.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Snaps the highlighted window to that half of its display — the same tile the global ⌃⌘-arrow chord makes, gap and width cycle included."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aimante la fenêtre sélectionnée sur cette moitié de son écran — le même pavage que le raccourci global ⌃⌘-flèche, écart et cycle des largeurs compris."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Source"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code source"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Space badges": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space badges"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pastilles de bureau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Space left around a tiled window: the full gap against a screen edge, half of it where two windows meet — so neighbours sit exactly one gap apart. 0 keeps them flush.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Space left around a tiled window: the full gap against a screen edge, half of it where two windows meet — so neighbours sit exactly one gap apart. 0 keeps them flush."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espace laissé autour d'une fenêtre pavée : l'écart entier contre un bord d'écran, la moitié là où deux fenêtres se rejoignent — les voisines sont ainsi séparées d'exactement un écart. 0 les laisse jointives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Star an app to keep it in the switcher even when it isn't running; picking it launches it. Excluded apps never appear.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Star an app to keep it in the switcher even when it isn't running; picking it launches it. Excluded apps never appear."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marquez une application d'une étoile pour la garder dans le sélecteur même lorsqu'elle ne tourne pas ; la choisir la lance. Les applications exclues n'apparaissent jamais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
