    "Switch to the desktop the window landed on, so you arrive with it instead of watching it go. Turn this off to throw a window somewhere and stay where you are.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to the desktop the window landed on, so you arrive with it instead of watching it go. Turn this off to throw a window somewhere and stay where you are."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bascule vers le bureau où la fenêtre a atterri, pour arriver avec elle au lieu de la regarder partir. Désactivez pour envoyer une fenêtre ailleurs et rester où vous êtes."
