            "value": "Ce fichier n'a pas pu être lu comme des réglages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The anchor the hold-and-point gesture measures its direction from. The outline and the landing block are not configurable — they match Rectangle's snap footprint: light grey on black.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The anchor the hold-and-point gesture measures its direction from. The outline and the landing block are not configurable — they match Rectangle's snap footprint: light grey on black."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le repère à partir duquel le geste « maintenir et pointer » mesure sa direction. Le contour et la zone d'arrivée ne sont pas configurables — ils reprennent l'empreinte d'aimantation de Rectangle : gris clair sur noir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The block showing where the window will end up. Drawn as a solid border with the fill washed back, so one colour covers both.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The block showing where the window will end up. Drawn as a solid border with the fill washed back, so one colour covers both."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bloc indiquant où la fenêtre va atterrir. Dessiné en bordure pleine avec un remplissage atténué, pour qu'une seule couleur suffise aux deux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The border drawn around the window a gesture is about to act on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The border drawn around the window a gesture is about to act on."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bordure dessinée autour de la fenêtre sur laquelle un geste va agir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The frosted glass behind the tiles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frosted glass behind the tiles."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le verre dépoli derrière les vignettes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The green button: maximize, or restore a zoomed window.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The green button: maximize, or restore a zoomed window."
