    "Wait before drawing the panel, so a quick tap switches with no flash. 0 = instant.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wait before drawing the panel, so a quick tap switches with no flash. 0 = instant."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attendre avant de dessiner le panneau, pour qu'une pression rapide bascule sans clignotement. 0 = immédiat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warp the cursor onto the window after it lands on the other display, so the next click and the next hover are where you are looking. Off leaves the pointer on the display you threw the window from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warp the cursor onto the window after it lands on the other display, so the next click and the next hover are where you are looking. Off leaves the pointer on the display you threw the window from."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amène le curseur sur la fenêtre une fois arrivée sur l'autre écran, pour que le prochain clic et le prochain survol soient là où vous regardez. Désactivé, le pointeur reste sur l'écran d'où vous avez envoyé la fenêtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What each tile stands for.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What each tile stands for."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que représente chaque vignette."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What opens the switcher, and what the keys do while it is up.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What opens the switcher, and what the keys do while it is up."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui ouvre le sélecteur, et ce que font les touches pendant qu'il est ouvert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where on a display the panel opens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where on a display the panel opens."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'endroit de l'écran où le panneau s'ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which Desktop a window is on. Only ever appears when you have more than one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which Desktop a window is on. Only ever appears when you have more than one."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bureau sur lequel se trouve une fenêtre. N'apparaît que si vous en avez plusieurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which Desktops window tiles may come from. Application tiles are never affected — an app is not on a Desktop. Read fresh each time the switcher opens, so it follows you the moment you switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which Desktops window tiles may come from. Application tiles are never affected — an app is not on a Desktop. Read fresh each time the switcher opens, so it follows you the moment you switch."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les bureaux dont peuvent provenir les vignettes de fenêtre. Les vignettes d'application ne sont jamais concernées — une application n'est pas sur un bureau. Relu à chaque ouverture du sélecteur, il vous suit donc dès que vous changez de bureau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which display a window is on. Only ever appears when more than one is connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which display a window is on. Only ever appears when more than one is connected."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'écran sur lequel se trouve une fenêtre. N'apparaît que si plusieurs sont connectés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which displays get a panel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which displays get a panel."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les écrans qui reçoivent un panneau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which icon the menu-bar item shows.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which icon the menu-bar item shows."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'icône affichée dans la barre des menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While the modifier is held, the drag is Cmd-Tab's and the app underneath never sees it — so a move across a document does not select text on the way. Independent of the tiling switch above, and of Snap by dragging.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While the modifier is held, the drag is Cmd-Tab's and the app underneath never sees it — so a move across a document does not select text on the way. Independent of the tiling switch above, and of Snap by dragging."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que le modificateur est maintenu, le glissement appartient à Cmd-Tab et l'application en dessous ne le voit jamais — un déplacement au-dessus d'un document ne sélectionne donc pas de texte au passage. Indépendant de l'interrupteur de pavage ci-dessus et de l'aimantation par glissement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
